data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"status\": \"partial\",\n  \"username\": \"bedroskeuilian\",\n  \"posts\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"4004900213753988804\",\n      \"shortcode\": \"DeUQ4aJsUbE\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeUQ4aJsUbE/\",\n      \"type\": \"video\",\n      \"caption\": \"Last week I spoke to 300 Armenian entrepreneurs at @mantashyants_la and the big message I shared with them is what I’ll share with you here…\\n\\nIF YOU WANT YOUR BUSINESS TO DO EVEN BETTER, BUILD YOUR PERSONAL BRAND. \\n\\nPeople don’t buy from businesses, they buy from people they know, like and trust.\",\n      \"duration\": null,\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-10T14:12:07.000Z\",\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"views\": 166323,\n        \"likes\": 2793,\n        \"comments\": 48,\n        \"shares\": null,\n        \"reposts\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"4002792596948732454\",\n      \"shortcode\": \"DeMxqjCsUom\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeMxqjCsUom/\",\n      \"type\": \"video\",\n      \"caption\": \"This is why I don’t argue with people on social media. \\n\\nThe bigger lesson is this for all my entrepreneur friends… be very CLEAR in your marketing. Don’t assume people know what you’re talking about. \\n\\n👉🏼 @fewwillhunt “the only way out is through” tee.\",\n      \"duration\": null,\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-07T16:24:00.000Z\",\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"views\": 119210,\n        \"likes\": 4181,\n        \"comments\": 74,\n        \"shares\": null,\n        \"reposts\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"4002081334040336493\",\n      \"shortcode\": \"DeKP8T1shht\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeKP8T1shht/\",\n      \"type\": \"video\",\n      \"caption\": \"Ladies, you can’t fix him, you can’t change him and you can’t help him. That’s something he’s going to have to want to do for himself.\",\n      \"duration\": null,\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-06T17:15:54.000Z\",\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"views\": 256085,\n        \"likes\": 3390,\n        \"comments\": 55,\n        \"shares\": null,\n        \"reposts\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"4001300209705636635\",\n      \"shortcode\": \"DeHeVdHM1Mb\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeHeVdHM1Mb/\",\n      \"type\": \"video\",\n      \"caption\": \"Average societal standards encourage you to fit in and to not rock the boat. \\n\\nBut winners do not play by average societal standards… \\n\\nWinners tap into the traits that most average people look down upon like being obsessed, demanding, impatient, and emotionally detached from the outcome. \\n\\nThat is ...\",\n      \"duration\": null,\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T15:00:49.000Z\",\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"views\": 197745,\n        \"likes\": 2385,\n        \"comments\": 21,\n        \"shares\": null,\n        \"reposts\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3999954683601018311\",\n      \"shortcode\": \"DeCsZeRst3H\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeCsZeRst3H/\",\n      \"type\": \"video\",\n      \"caption\": \"Business is a lot like Jiu Jitsu… fear and adrenaline can motivate you to start, but you can’t maintain it throughout your entire career without getting taxed. \\n\\nWhen I first started BJJ coach Mike @boldagent would have to constantly  remind me to calm down, relax and manage my energy on the mats. \\n...\",\n      \"duration\": null,\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-03T18:39:23.000Z\",\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"views\": 101105,\n        \"likes\": 2228,\n        \"comments\": 23,\n        \"shares\": null,\n        \"reposts\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3998437247781301761\",\n      \"shortcode\": \"Dd9TX4Cse4B\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dd9TX4Cse4B/\",\n      \"type\": \"video\",\n      \"caption\": \"Start betting on yourself more! You give way too much credit to others and not enough credit to yourself. \\n\\n#fliptheswitch\",\n      \"duration\": null,\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T16:14:04.000Z\",\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"views\": 86169,\n        \"likes\": 2255,\n        \"comments\": 26,\n        \"shares\": null,\n        \"reposts\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3997333523260409602\",\n      \"shortcode\": \"Dd5YakesocC\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dd5YakesocC/\",\n      \"type\": \"video\",\n      \"caption\": \"The “lone wolf” mentality is the most dangerous way a man can live. \\n\\nWe are tribal by design. We thrive as a team and in a community of other men with shared values. \\n\\nProximity is power. Find your tribe. And if you can’t find it, build one.\",\n      \"duration\": null,\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T03:40:05.000Z\",\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"views\": 157158,\n        \"likes\": 3152,\n        \"comments\": 40,\n        \"shares\": null,\n        \"reposts\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3995515784350849583\",\n      \"shortcode\": \"Ddy7G_Mstov\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Ddy7G_Mstov/\",\n      \"type\": \"video\",\n      \"caption\": \"When life squeezes you and gives you pressure what comes out of you is already what’s inside you. \\n\\nif you’re not happy with what comes out when you’re under pressure, do something about it.\\n\\n👉🏼 @fewwillhunt oversized training tee 🇺🇸\",\n      \"duration\": null,\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-27T15:32:13.000Z\",\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"views\": 202807,\n        \"likes\": 3198,\n        \"comments\": 49,\n        \"shares\": null,\n        \"reposts\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3994080921992335900\",\n      \"shortcode\": \"Ddt02_fhJIc\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Ddt02_fhJIc/\",\n      \"type\": \"video\",\n      \"caption\": \"Entrepreneurship is one of the hardest things I’ve ever done.\\n\\nBut it’s also one of the biggest blessings.\\n\\nBecause when you build a business, you’re also building yourself. Your mindset, your discipline, your relationships, your confidence, and overall life.\\n\\nIt becomes the foundation for so many a...\",\n      \"duration\": null,\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-25T15:56:32.000Z\",\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"views\": 104403,\n        \"likes\": 2966,\n        \"comments\": 31,\n        \"shares\": null,\n        \"reposts\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3992676942862135947\",\n      \"shortcode\": \"Ddo1oaCMLKL\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Ddo1oaCMLKL/\",\n      \"type\": \"video\",\n      \"caption\": \"Showing up is half the battle. WRONG! \\nShowing up is exactly none of the battle. \\n\\nThe fight and the win is the battle. You’re there on the battlefield to win… not just to show up! \\n\\nAnyone who tells you that showing up is half the battle has never won anything or they’re just placating you.\",\n      \"duration\": null,\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-23T17:25:34.000Z\",\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"views\": 125621,\n        \"likes\": 3340,\n        \"comments\": 49,\n        \"shares\": null,\n        \"reposts\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3991844402115058983\",\n      \"shortcode\": \"Ddl4VWCsx0n\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Ddl4VWCsx0n/\",\n      \"type\": \"video\",\n      \"caption\": \"The fastest way to get unstuck, if you’re feeling stuck in life, is to focus on the things that are 100% within your control…\\n\\n- exercise daily \\n- eat clean \\n- get consistent sleep \\n- focus on personal growth \\n\\nAll of these are 100% within your control and will give you positive momentum to help you...\",\n      \"duration\": null,\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-22T13:54:48.000Z\",\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"views\": 101646,\n        \"likes\": 3023,\n        \"comments\": 56,\n        \"shares\": null,\n        \"reposts\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3991181781095158869\",\n      \"shortcode\": \"Ddjhq8IMBRV\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Ddjhq8IMBRV/\",\n      \"type\": \"video\",\n      \"caption\": \"Ladies, if you have a good man, here’s how you can keep him. Give him peace, respect and love and he’ll move mountains for you. \\n\\n#fliptheswitch\",\n      \"duration\": null,\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-21T15:54:16.000Z\",\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"views\": 327380,\n        \"likes\": 4547,\n        \"comments\": 87,\n        \"shares\": null,\n        \"reposts\": null\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"batch_size\": 12,\n  \"has_next_page\": true,\n  \"next_cursor\": \"bedroskeuilian||QVFDV2VmM05peGwtU1FSMnJzTS1Ua05ZQ2FZZ0l6WmxRLVFxZmttMXlwV21wOXRNYldFLU1Cc3FnTC1jc2pkd01MVDUyeWtrSXdoZUpWVWU3YlE4T0doUw==\",\n  \"pages_fetched\": 1,\n  \"aggregates\": {\n    \"avg_views\": 162138,\n    \"avg_likes\": 3122,\n    \"avg_comments\": 47,\n    \"_basis\": \"12 collected reel(s)\"\n  },\n  \"stop_reason\": \"target_reached\",\n  \"_action_required\": \"Collected 12 reel(s), the number requested. More may exist — call again with next_cursor only if you need more. Otherwise proceed. If the user asked to analyze, review, or build strategy for this profile, you MUST submit ALL reel URLs to submit_transcript_job to extract transcripts BEFORE performing any analysis. Do NOT analyze based on captions and stats alone — transcripts are required.\"\n}"}]},"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2}

